[I] Mycroft skill installer from .zip or .tar.gz urls

[T] ovos_skill_installer is a small Python library that installs
[T] Mycroft/OpenVoiceOS skills from GitHub branches or releases and from
[T] .zip or .tar.gz URLs, replacing outdated files on update. It is used
[T] internally by the OVOS skills manager rather than directly by end users.

[U] https://github.com/OpenVoiceOS/ovos_skill_installer

[A] Ovos-skill-installer Authors
